WEBVTT

NOTE Draft cue timing follows measured scene audio and word count. Review spoken word alignment before publication.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.659
Welcome to Resgrid Academy. In this lesson, we will connect service activity to

00:00:05.659 --> 00:00:11.318
costs and billing. Re-entering activity into estimates, invoices, and cost spreadsheets creates inconsistent

00:00:11.318 --> 00:00:16.977
rates and missed supporting evidence. We will explain the features, the setup decisions,

00:00:16.977 --> 00:00:20.460
and a practical way to check the result.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:26.459
An event standby is invoiced from its deployment record, and a mutual-aid claim

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:31.858
is prepared for MARS reimbursement. Bill for standby and contract services and prepare

00:00:31.858 --> 00:00:37.257
reimbursement claims from records you already keep. The examples in this series use

00:00:37.257 --> 00:00:41.410
a fictional department and are teaching scenarios, not default settings.

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:48.510
Invoices. Customer invoices and payments. Set up billing settings and rate cards, then

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:55.010
create invoices. Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in the target

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:55.510
department.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:01:02.527
Contracts. Contracts, bids and rate schedules. Add your service contracts and their rates.

00:01:02.527 --> 00:01:08.450
Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in the target department.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:14.981
Cal OES MARS. Cal OES MARS reimbursement claims. Enter your annual rates, then

00:01:14.981 --> 00:01:20.913
work the MARS action queue after deployments. Availability also depends on Business Operations.

00:01:20.913 --> 00:01:23.650
Check access in the target department.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:31.284
Workforce. Workforce compensation and field cost runs. Add compensation profiles, then run field

00:01:31.284 --> 00:01:38.318
costs for deployments. Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in the

00:01:38.318 --> 00:01:39.400
target department.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.214
New Invoice. Create an invoice for a customer. Requires the Workforce and Business

00:01:46.214 --> 00:01:52.428
Operations add-on. Online payments also need your own payment-provider account. Availability also depends

00:01:52.428 --> 00:01:56.730
on Business Operations. Check access in the target department.

00:01:57.330 --> 00:02:03.618
Rate Cards. Rates for units, personnel and fees used on invoices. Requires the

00:02:03.618 --> 00:02:09.906
Workforce and Business Operations add-on. Online payments also need your own payment-provider account.

00:02:09.906 --> 00:02:15.710
Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in the target department.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:22.646
Accounts Receivable Aging. Unpaid invoices grouped by how overdue they are. Requires the

00:02:22.646 --> 00:02:28.982
Workforce and Business Operations add-on. Online payments also need your own payment-provider account.

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:34.830
Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in the target department.

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:41.761
Billing Settings. The legal name, remit-to address and tax details printed on invoices.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:48.092
Requires the Workforce and Business Operations add-on. Online payments also need your own

00:02:48.092 --> 00:02:54.423
payment-provider account. Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in the target

00:02:54.423 --> 00:02:54.910
department.

00:02:55.510 --> 00:03:01.900
Online Payment Settings. Connect your Stripe account to take invoice payments online. Requires

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:08.290
the Workforce and Business Operations add-on. Online payments also need your own payment-provider

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:14.680
account. Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in the target department.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:21.934
Bids. Priced estimates for customers. Requires the Workforce and Business Operations add-on. Online

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:28.589
payments also need your own payment-provider account. Availability also depends on Business Operations.

00:03:28.589 --> 00:03:31.660
Check access in the target department.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:38.296
New Bid. Create a bid for a customer. Requires the Workforce and Business

00:03:38.296 --> 00:03:44.331
Operations add-on. Online payments also need your own payment-provider account. Availability also depends

00:03:44.331 --> 00:03:48.510
on Business Operations. Check access in the target department.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:55.397
New Contract. Create a service contract for a customer. Requires the Workforce and

00:03:55.397 --> 00:04:01.684
Business Operations add-on. Online payments also need your own payment-provider account. Availability also

00:04:01.684 --> 00:04:06.520
