00:06:55.928 --> 00:06:56.830
target department.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:04.507
California Pay Data Reporting. Prepare California pay data reports. Also requires Advanced Data

00:07:04.507 --> 00:07:11.585
Protection. Requires the Workforce and Business Operations add-on. Online payments also need your

00:07:11.585 --> 00:07:18.662
