00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:28.091
My Demographic Response. Your voluntary answers for California pay data reporting. Requires the

00:07:28.091 --> 00:07:34.741
Workforce and Business Operations add-on. Online payments also need your own payment-provider account.

00:07:34.741 --> 00:07:40.880
Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in the target department.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:48.710
Business Operations. The Workforce and Business Operations add-on: invoicing, payments, contracts, bids, MARS

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:55.941
reimbursement and workforce costing. Certifications and Deployment Finance do not require this add-on.

00:07:55.941 --> 00:08:03.171
Pay-data reporting additionally needs ADP Enabled; online payments require provider setup. No reimbursement

00:08:03.171 --> 00:08:10.401
or savings are guaranteed. Availability also depends on Business Operations. Check access in

00:08:10.401 --> 00:08:12.070
the target department.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:18.788
For the training scenario, work in this order. Step 1. Confirm Business Operations

00:08:18.788 --> 00:08:24.906
access and configure billing identity and approved rates. Step 2. Prepare a demo

00:08:24.906 --> 00:08:31.024
bid or contract and the corresponding service invoice. Step 3. Review payments, invoice

00:08:31.024 --> 00:08:35.260
aging, deployment costs, or MARS claim evidence as applicable.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:42.706
Now verify the result. Reconcile source activity, quantities, rates, totals, and recorded payment

00:08:42.706 --> 00:08:49.551
or claim outcomes. Use a payment-provider test environment. A common problem to watch

00:08:49.551 --> 00:08:56.397
for: Pay-data reporting also requires enabled Advanced Data Protection. Annual rates and reporting

00:08:56.397 --> 00:08:59.030
requirements need current finance review.

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:04.669
Your practice task is simple. Prepare a standby estimate and draft invoice from

00:09:04.669 --> 00:09:09.708
sample activity. Compare recorded cost with the billed amount and explain any difference.

00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:14.746
Record the result, who owns the follow-up, and when it should be reviewed.

00:09:14.746 --> 00:09:19.010
Use the linked feature scripts for the detailed screen recording plan.

